    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the executive law, the state finance law and the public\nauthorities law, in relation to establishing expanded construction mentorship\nopportunities for small and minority and women-owned business enterprises",
    "basePrintNo": "S6315",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6315-2025",
